  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: The melody strengthens. Each beat, a pulse of intention.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: You are not just playing notes. You are composing meaning.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: The silence between notes matters as much as the notes themselves.
